 ProjectAchilles installer                                 Certificates  4 / 10
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 The installer creates a private key and a certificate request (CSR) for
 achilles.corp.example.com in deploy/caddy/certs/. Your CA signs the request;
 you then point the installer at the signed chain.
 
 ┃ Include the IP 10.0.5.20 in the request?                                    
 ┃ This only adds the IP to the certificate request; it does not make the      
 ┃ server reachable by IP (the site answers on its DNS name only).             
 ┃                                                                             
 ┃                              Yes     No                                    











